<div class="qul-docs">
  <h2>About surah information</h2>

  <p>
    This resource holds background reading for each surah: its main themes and topics, the circumstances
    of its revelation, a summary, and other context that helps a reader place the surah.
  </p>

  <p>
    It is available in several languages, as <strong>SQLite</strong>, <strong>CSV</strong> and
    <strong>JSON</strong>. Some languages ship two versions — a short summary and a longer article.
  </p>

  <div class="docs-callout docs-callout-info">
    The long version contains HTML tags for headings, paragraphs and emphasis, so render it as HTML
    rather than as plain text.
  </div>
</div>
    
